# Ignore everything under _maintenance/ EXCEPT the release watcher's state file.
# The negation needs `_maintenance/*` (not `_maintenance/`): git cannot re-include
# a file whose parent directory is itself excluded.
# release-state.json must persist across runs or release-watch.yml re-reports
# every watched release every month.
_maintenance/*
!_maintenance/release-state.json
handoff/
